otally different thing, I keep forgetting to check and I need to plan around it, when's the yangshuo trip again?\", \"Great, and while I'm at it, what about the call flolara, when's that one?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w02-0023\", \"v\": [[\"marimba collective expenses\", \"just ones over thirteen kronor\"], [\"We're doing a bit of a money catch-up in the group soon, so can you show me everything spent in the marimba collective?\", \"That's a lot to wade through honestly, could you narrow it down to only the ones that were more than thirteen kronor?\"]], \"id_note\": null}\n{\"id\": \"w02-0024\", \"v\": [[\"I've been meaning to sort the money out properly for ages, so with Kalliope over in the trombone collective, can we just settle up now?\", \"Right, something else entirely, I realised the timing's a bit tight on the Kalliope one in my calendar, could you push it fifteen minutes later?\"], [\"can u sort Kalliope in trombone collective, wanna settle up\", \"diff thing, move the Kalliope one fifteen minutes later pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w02-0025\", \"v\": [[\"We did a drive out to a gig last week and they covered the fuel, so could you add five kronor for Kalliope's petrol to the trombone collective, with them as the one who paid?\", \"Would you mind adding five kronor for Kalliope's petrol to the trombone collective, please? Kalliope paid for it.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w02-0026\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please show me my photos of Losa?\", \"Thank you. Separately, could you tell me what the login is for the Kumluly streaming account? I don't need the password, just the login.\", \"On another matter, would you mind moving the instructor visit a day later, please?\", \"Thanks. Could you tell me who else will be there?\", \"One more thing, could you let me know what time the oud lesson is?\"], [\"Losa photos\", \"Kumluly streaming login? not password\", \"instructor visit a day later\", \"who else coming?\", \"oud lesson time?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w02-0027\", \"v\": [[\"log Leonie visit\"], [\"umm so I, I went round to see Leonie earlier, could you just... log that visit for me?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w02-0029\", \"v\": [[\"I'm putting together a little something for her and wondered, do I have any pictures of Ebba Veracre in there?\", \"Oh nice, that one reminds me I promised to do something with it, can you make me a to-do to sign the trombone photo on sunday?\"], [\"umm have I got any, like, photos of Ebba Veracre?\", \"oh ok, can you, uh, add a task to sign the trombone photo sunday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w02-0031\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please tell me who still owes me money?\", \"Sorry, before I forget, would you mind finding Anwar Demir in my contacts?\", \"Thank you. Going back to the money, could you show me only the ones who owe more than sixty?\"], [\"who still owes me money\", \"wait quick one, can u find Anwar Demir in my contacts\", \"ok back to the money thing, just the ones over sixty pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w02-0032\", \"v\": [[\"I want to get a card sorted in good time for once, so could you tell me when Ebba has her birthday?\"], [\"when's Ebba's birthday\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w02-0033\", \"v\": [[\"when's my Ebba dinner again\"], [\"Could you tell me when my Ebba dinner is scheduled, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w02-0035\", \"v\": [[\"Would you be able to order some more printer ink online for me, please?\"], [\"can u order more printer ink online, we're almost out\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w02-0036\", \"v\": [[\"dinner last tuesday, with who?\"], [\"hmm who did I, uh, who'd I have dinner with last tuesday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w02-0038\", \"v\": [[\"add water the plants for next monday pls\", \"also can u email Lilia the adress of the party\"], [\"ok so can you put, um, water the plants on my list for next monday?\", \"oh and uh, could you email Lilia the, the address of the party?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w02-0042\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please move the check-up to a day later?\"], [\"Something's come up and I really can't make it on the original day, so would you push the check-up back to a day later for me?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w02-0043\", \"v\": [[\"They keep asking me for it and I never remember it off the top of my head, so could you text Flovie the Drainpipe wifi details?\"], [\"umm can you text Flovie the, uh, the Drainpipe wifi?\"]]}","ttft_ms":11740,"type":"result","duration_ms":28956,"uuid":"8c3014af-9c0f-4134-8fdf-a2a3445a45a6","ttft_stream_ms":1631,"time_to_request_ms":174,"first_content_frame_ms":1631,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":21807034,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278356870.9182,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
